*raw_data*.txt
genome_*.txt
AncestryDNA*.txt

# Fixtures and synthetic genomes are the exception. Everything under this path
# is re-included, so nothing mechanical stops a real genome dropped in here —
# that protection is AGENTS.md's rule, not this file's.
!tests/data/**

